        "TileImage": "$($repository 3c125feb-13af-4fd2-9f85-f6c411c0162b).Image",
        "Description": "Demons to some...  Agents to others...\r\rWhile on the Isle of Sgail for an unsavory photo session, debonair hedonist Flynn Sharp recklessly absconded with a puzzle box known as the Burnwood Configuration.\r\rLittle does he know that you&apos;ll be lying in wait should he open it, ready to pull his hellbound heart back into the box and tear apart the souls of all those seeking legendary suffering.\r\rP.S. try to bring some glue and nails to Carlisle Manor, 47.  That Pinhead costume is calling your name...",
